│ patch_type               │ diff                                                                                      │
│ patch_name               │ stratified_chance_sampling                                                                │
│ patch_description        │ Replace random without-replacement insertion-rank sampling with deterministic stratified  │
│                          │ sampling across all currently empty cells.                                                │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ The lookahead estimates an expectation over uniformly random placements. The existing     │
│                          │ random samples remain noisy with only 18/7 samples, and—more importantly—each candidate   │
│                          │ root tilt consumes a different random sequence. This makes action selection partially     │
│                          │ depend on Monte Carlo noise rather than the actual difference between tilts.              │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ Stratified ranks cover the entire empty-cell ordering evenly, while using a deterministic │
│                          │ turn-dependent rotation so that the sampled portions vary across turns. Candidate         │
│                          │ directions at the same lookahead level use identical rank strata, acting as common random │
│                          │ numbers and substantially reducing comparison variance. It also removes shuffle setup and │
│                          │ RNG calls from the most frequently executed search path.                                  │
│ num_applied              │ 1                                                                                         │
│ api_costs                │ $0.0327                                                                                   │
